WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:04.280
If the topic of politics hasn’t been terrifying
enough for you over the past several years,

00:00:04.280 --> 00:00:09.690
let us introduce to you SCP-1981: The even
more frightening version of ex-president Ronald

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:10.690
Reagan.

00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:14.599
Well, technically it’s an old VHS tape of
Ronald Reagan giving a speech, which doesn’t

00:00:14.599 --> 00:00:17.010
take long to become traumatic and disturbing.

00:00:17.010 --> 00:00:21.130
As the speech goes on, Reagan seems to fall
apart and zombify, often being mutilated in

00:00:21.130 --> 00:00:24.130
various disgusting ways that vary from play
to play.

00:00:24.130 --> 00:00:29.140
His speech also devolves into violent, frightening
nonsense, as well as sometimes differing from

00:00:29.140 --> 00:00:30.670
a typical Reagan speech.

00:00:30.670 --> 00:00:35.039
Most frightening of all is that sometimes
a figure in a black cloak will appear on screen.

00:00:35.039 --> 00:00:38.989
To this day, nobody knows exactly who this
figure is, or what the true origin or purpose

00:00:38.989 --> 00:00:40.109
of the tape is.

00:00:40.109 --> 00:00:43.969
And according to some reports, being subjected
to the tape and then being given a botched

00:00:43.969 --> 00:00:48.579
amnestic treatment afterwards was a major
contributing factor in the death of the real-life

00:00:48.579 --> 00:00:49.730
Ronald Reagan.

00:00:49.730 --> 00:00:50.730
Conspiracy much?

00:00:50.730 --> 00:00:51.730
Maybe.

00:00:51.730 --> 00:00:51.899
Maybe not.

